### Test UE Assignment Fix
### This file tests if the UE assignment transaction errors are fixed

### 1. Login as Admin
POST http://localhost:8086/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@saintjeaningenieur.org",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Get UE Statistics (should work without 500 error)
GET http://localhost:8086/api/ues/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. Get all UEs
GET http://localhost:8086/api/ues
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Assign Pascal Abega to UE ID 3 (should work without transaction error)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/ues/3/enseignants/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 5. Try simple assignment (fallback method)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/ues/3/enseignants/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746/simple
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 6. Verify assignment worked - get UE details
GET http://localhost:8086/api/ues/3
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 7. Test with another UE (ID 1)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/ues/1/enseignants/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 8. Check Pascal's UE assignments
GET http://localhost:8086/api/ues/enseignant/8924dc7b-8a43-402c-9756-066925fd6746
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}